{"id":"619935161","kind":"article","title":"普及具有新颖认知支持的文字媒体需要普及电子阅读","author":"Andy Matuschak","original_authors":["Andy Matuschak"],"original_source_urls":["https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z4ANG1DVEjkbEwkhbeKtMYRGYbHGUW3mcc9aA"],"publisher":"Jarrett Ye","column":"助记媒介 & 思想工具","date":"2023-04-09","updated":"2024-05-23","votes":5,"comment_count":0,"minutes":1,"chars":387,"keywords":["电子阅读","助记媒介","网页出版","电子书","数字阅读"],"summary":"译文指出，电脑阅读体验不佳可能是电子书未普及的原因之一；作者还认为，助记媒介的普及依赖网页出版扩展。","zhihu_url":"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/619935161","restoration":null,"toc":[{"id":"sec-1","level":2,"title":"链接至本文（已汉化）"},{"id":"sec-2","level":2,"title":"声明"}],"html":"<p data-pid=\"JEmOQVWR\">不幸的是，<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z7yjjydTNu3bujTeFc7Hey1iFbz513SnN6oss\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">在电脑上阅读文本令人不快</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-1\"><a href=\"#ref-1\">[1]</a></sup>。或许这也部分解释了为什么<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/zzdVtwtw3NScf2xcUZk2agkRhaMKkt47VuL\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">电子书的流行程度远低于纸质书</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-2\"><a href=\"#ref-2\">[2]</a></sup>。</p><p data-pid=\"1CXsGya1\">在创作方面也存在挑战：</p><ul><li data-pid=\"1z2Yrrxc\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/zLbzDQF4MLSUEgDKu16i2h9q1ea8jC5crTV\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">普及助记媒介似乎需要网页出版的普及</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-3\"><a href=\"#ref-3\">[3]</a></sup><br/> </li><li data-pid=\"CG7k6tEx\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z21AqLend3rKZvTaemNFp1QDRAYQmTLVM4AC\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">作者可能会从纸质书销售中赚取更多收入（在也销售电子书的同时）</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-4\"><a href=\"#ref-4\">[4]</a></sup><br/> </li></ul><h2 id=\"sec-1\">链接至本文（已汉化）</h2><ul><li data-pid=\"sPrHPysG\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"620532040\" href=\"#/post/620532040\">在电脑上阅读文本令人不快</a></li><li data-pid=\"clKBNTH8\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"699342664\" href=\"#/post/699342664\">普及助记媒介似乎需要网页出版的普及</a></li></ul><h2 id=\"sec-2\">声明</h2><p data-pid=\"a1kSLiu9\">此内容发布由 Andy Matuschak 许可。未经允许，不得转载或修改。保留所有权利。</p><p class=\"ztext-empty-paragraph\"><br/></p><blockquote data-pid=\"X2_tKMDy\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"http://paratranz.cn/projects/3131\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Thoughts Memo</a> 汉化组译制<br/>感谢主要译者 Jarrett Ye<br/>原文：<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z4ANG1DVEjkbEwkhbeKtMYRGYbHGUW3mcc9aA\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Mass adoption of written media with novel cognitive supports requires mass adoption of reading on computers (andymatuschak.org)</a></blockquote><hr/><ol class=\"references\"><li id=\"ref-1\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-1\">↩</a> 在电脑上阅读文本令人不快 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"620532040\" href=\"#/post/620532040\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-2\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-2\">↩</a> 电子书的流行程度远低于纸质书 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"661273104\" href=\"#/post/661273104\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-3\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-3\">↩</a> 普及助记媒介似乎需要网页出版的普及 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"699342664\" href=\"#/post/699342664\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-4\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-4\">↩</a> 作者可能会从纸质书销售中赚取更多收入（在也销售电子书的同时） <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"641059991\" href=\"#/post/641059991\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li></ol>","rec_chain":[{"id":"619935591","title":"连续滚动式的电子阅读扰乱了物体恒存性，令人不适","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":19,"minutes":2,"reason":"同专栏上一篇 · 助记媒介 & 思想工具"},{"id":"620532040","title":"在电脑上阅读文本令人不快","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":25,"minutes":1,"reason":"同专栏下一篇 · 助记媒介 & 思想工具"},{"id":"641059991","title":"作者可能会从纸质书销售中赚取更多收入（在也销售电子书的同时）","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":5,"minutes":1,"reason":"本文直接引用"},{"id":"699342664","title":"普及助记媒介似乎需要网页出版的普及","author":"Andy Matu